1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,360
It's been a while,

25
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:55,200
Brother Ceng Niu is still as graceful as before.

26
00:01:52,520 --> 00:01:55,480
Mo Zhi
Envoy of the Cultivation Alliance

27
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:58,720
Brother Mo Zhi.

28
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,880
Yes, it's me.

29
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:02,640
You, step back.

30
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,480
I have a question,

31
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:08,920
I hope Brother Ceng Niu can answer it.

32
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,440
Why did you

33
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:14,400
refuse to become the next Suzaku ?

34
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:16,880
So that's how it is...

35
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:20,320
It's not that the Cultivation Planet Crystal chose me

36
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:21,480
but rather...

37
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:24,040
he chose me.

38
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:26,560
My ambitions

39
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:27,920
are higher than planet Suzaku.

40
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,640
It's a shame...

41
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:33,840
Since Brother Ceng Niu made up his mind,

42
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:36,520
then I will not try to persuade you.

43
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:52,840
Repair.

44
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:55,240
This is the Cultivation Planet Heart.

45
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:57,480
The one who obtains it,

46
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:59,880
becomes the next Suzaku.

47
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:01,880
The Cultivation Planet Heart...

48
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:04,280
But my cultivation is too low...

49
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:07,760
The one who obtains it can directly become the Suzaku ?

50
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:12,760
Middle stage Soul Transformation ?

51
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:15,720
How did her cultivation increase so drastically ?

52
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:16,880
No...

53
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:18,560
This aura...

54
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:20,800
It's Qian Feng !

55
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:23,160
A cultivation furnace

56
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:25,600
that was able to reverse her fate ?

57
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,720
How rare...

58
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:30,960
Azure Dragon bloodline,

59
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:33,040
you are also a qualified candidate.

60
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:34,480
Unfortunately,

61
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,040
you are not Soul Transformation

62
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,800
so you won't be respected.

63
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,160
In that case,

64
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,720
the next Suzaku shall be...

65
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,120
Brother Mo, wait a minute.

66
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:53,040
Although he hasn’t reached Soul Transformation,

67
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:54,800
that doesn’t mean he never will.

68
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:57,280
Wang Lin,

69
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:58,840
what do you mean by that ?

70
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,800
What does Brother Mo think ?

71
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:03,440
Wang Lin !

72
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:07,640
Your Billion-Soul Flag is useless now

73
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:09,520
and you are just Early stage Soul Transformation.

74
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:11,160
If I want to kill you,

75
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:13,000
it would be as easy as waving my hand !

76
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:15,360
And if I agree to become the next Suzaku ?

77
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:16,360
You !

78
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:28,560
Brother Ceng Niu, have you...

79
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,000
changed your mind ?

80
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:31,920
Do you really need to ask ?

81
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:33,760
Even if I become the Suzaku,

82
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:35,680
I would just pass the title

83
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:36,840
to him.

84
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:42,600
Interesting...

85
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:43,680
Interesting...

86
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,320
In that case,

87
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,000
from now on,

88
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:50,680
you are the 15th generation Suzaku.

89
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:53,680
I hope you will cultivate diligently here,

90
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:56,640
and properly comprehend the Suzaku Seal.

91
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,920
Forsaken Immortal Clan,

92
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:41,760
I can give you a third of planet Suzaku.

93
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,680
But every thousand years,

94
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:47,160
you must deliver at least a 9-Leaf's skull.

95
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:48,800
Yunque Zi,

96
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,800
do you agree ?

97
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:58,480
It's decided.

98
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,200
Thank you.

99
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:11,040
It's nothing,

100
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,480
you don't need to thank me.

101
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:15,160
Brother Ceng Niu,

102
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:19,240
I may need your help in the future.

103
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:22,360
I hope you will not refuse then.

104
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:24,280
Naturally.

105
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:27,200
I must now return to the Cultivation Alliance to report,

106
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:30,040
would Brother Ceng Niu like to leave with me ?

107
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:33,800
I still have some matters to deal with.

108
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:37,000
Use your celestial spiritual energy in this seal

109
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:38,280
and you can leave.

110
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:42,280
Brother Ceng Niu,

111
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:44,440
the path of immortality is long.

112
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:45,920
I hope that

113
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:48,640
we will meet again.

114
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:58,520
I have obtained both my and Wan'er's soul strand.

115
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:00,520
No one can control our lives anymore.

116
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:03,560
The Billion-Soul Flag is greatly weakened.

117
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:05,080
After I leave,

118
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:08,120
I need to find enough souls to repair it.

119
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:11,160
The next Suzaku is Zhou Wutai.

120
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:13,440
He is a grateful and righteous man.

121
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,480
Even if I leave,

122
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:18,560
he will take good care of my acquaintances.

123
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:20,600
That means

124
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:23,680
I no longer need to worry about them.

125
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,680
Xu Liguo.

126
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:33,800
Master,

127
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:36,160
I have tamed this half-moon blade.

128
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:37,880
It's very obedient.

129
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:39,880
This half-moon blade is pretty mysterious.

130
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:41,800
I'm sure it will be useful.

131
00:07:41,840 --> 00:07:42,930
Number Four,

132
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,320
come and greet Master.

133
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:52,880
Greetings,

134
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:54,680
Master...?

135
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:56,720
This half-moon blade is hard to tame,

136
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:59,760
I can't even imprint my Divine Sense on it.

137
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:02,720
But somehow, it really likes Xu Liguo...

138
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:05,640
Alright,

139
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,320
as long as I can control it indirectly

140
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:09,800
and make it serve me.

141
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,360
Number Four, let's go !

142
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:28,560
1 year later

143
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:37,080
Falling from the night sky

144
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:39,440
and melting into dust

145
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:41,800
like water without a source.

146
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,520
Like the difference between clouds and mud,

147
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:48,000
the truth cannot be found in conflict.

148
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:52,160
Life and death
are like the moment when the rain falls.

149
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:56,760
And like many other unseparable things.

150
00:08:56,800 --> 00:08:59,400
In this lifetime,

151
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:01,840
to cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

152
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:09,600
Old grudges had to be settled

153
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:09,600
because half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

154
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:15,640
Use the most vivid love and hate

155
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:15,640
to ask questions to your fate.

156
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:20,040
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage
to pierce the heart and the soul

157
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:23,760
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

158
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:25,200
Only when you bend

159
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:29,220
can you understand the hidden edge of the blade.

160
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,640
The human mind is nature,

161
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:33,760
the rain fell silently like an answer.

162
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:35,480
Life and death are just moments away,

163
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:38,000
there are many other solutions to grudges.

164
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:43,190
Use your dusty heart
to depict the world.

165
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:47,480
One stroke is for killing.

166
00:09:45,760 --> 00:09:47,480
After struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

167
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:51,480
One stroke is for caring.

168
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:51,480
Everywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

169
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:56,160
Give up your mind to be refined
by this endless world.

170
00:09:57,840 --> 00:10:03,360
Snow falls as my hair turns white, winter withers
while prosperity sprouts in summer.

171
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:09,800
I step into the world, with light at my fingertips,
the law of cause and effect.

172
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:16,240
I observe the vastness of heaven and earth
so I can get rid of evil.

173
00:10:17,750 --> 00:10:23,840
Obsession arises from one thought, life and death arise from one thought.
Reincarnation is not to be feared.

174
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:47,960
Over the past year,

175
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:52,000
the Forsaken Immortal Clan retreated to the northwest of planet Suzaku.

176
00:08:52,400 --> 00:08:55,200
From now on, they will no longer bother the cultivators.

177
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:00,640
After this war,

178
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,840
more than half of planet Suzaku's cultivators died.

179
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:06,200
Most sects and countries are severely weakened.

180
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,720
The Forsaken Immortal Clan retreated,

181
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:10,080
we have driven them away !

182
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:11,760
This is great, we won !

183
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:15,000
Zhou Wutai knew that he needed to be respected.

184
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:17,120
So right after leaving the Suzaku Tomb,

185
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:19,080
he went into seclusion on Mount Suzaku.

186
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:22,080
As for Zi Xin and Liu Mei,

187
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,560
I heard that both of them flew into the starry sky.

188
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:29,910
I wanted to recover the 4th primary soul that Zhuque Zi stole,

189
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:31,920
but I wasn't able to find it.

190
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:41,280
Little Ru'er is luckier than me.

191
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:43,600
At least she has a home to return to

192
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:45,520
and a chance to live with her parents.

193
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:50,400
If Little Ru'er ever cultivates to Nascent Soul,

194
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:54,520
Tie Yan will give this to her.

195
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,720
Before leaving,

196
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:01,880
I went to the old country of Xue Yue.

197
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:05,640
Even in this bitter cold,

198
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:07,720
I still found

199
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:09,800
flowers blooming.

200
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:26,640
Finally,

201
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:29,240
I returned to the place where I was born.

202
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:41,280
My son, it doesn't matter if you are not chosen.

203
00:10:38,560 --> 00:10:42,080
Tie Zhu, you really look like an Immortal now.

204
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,160
You can always come back.

205
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:44,160
Noooo !!!

206
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:51,960
Father...

207
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:53,720
Mother...

208
00:10:56,560 --> 00:10:58,200
Your son is going to leave…

209
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:33,480
Country of Zhou
Rank 4 cultivation country

210
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:36,920
Keep playing music !

211
00:11:37,680 --> 00:11:38,600
Keep dancing !

212
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:39,640
Your Highness,

213
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:41,840
let me dance another song for you.

214
00:11:41,880 --> 00:11:43,000
Situ,

215
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:44,600
it's time to go.

216
00:11:45,520 --> 00:11:46,640
That was too quick...

217
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:50,600
Little Lin,

218
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:52,960
do you want to know why I cultivate ?

219
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,040
Let me tell you,

220
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:58,000
I cultivate because I want all treasures and women

221
00:11:58,360 --> 00:12:00,040
of this world to be mine !

222
00:12:00,560 --> 00:12:02,880
If I didn't keep running into strong enemies,

223
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:05,560
that forced me to cultivate to beat them,

224
00:12:05,640 --> 00:12:07,000
I would have quit

225
00:12:07,040 --> 00:12:08,240
cultivating long ago !

226
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:13,600
Situ,

227
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:16,400
your Dao and mine are different.

228
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:21,880
Let's go.

229
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:24,800
Let's make our own cultivation country.

230
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:29,960
Fool...

231
00:12:40,160 --> 00:12:41,480
This is the cloud barrier.

232
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:43,000
After we cross it,

233
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:44,760
we will have left planet Suzaku.

234
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:46,550
Original body,

235
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:47,320
come !

236
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:09,080
Good !

237
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:12,000
Like this, you are Peak Middle stage Soul Transformation !

238
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:23,120
Disperse for me !

239
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:36,720
Brother Wang,

240
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:38,320
have a safe journey.

241
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:46,360
The younger generations will always surpass us...

242
00:13:53,360 --> 00:13:54,560
Uncle ?

243
00:13:56,400 --> 00:13:58,680
Goodbye, Ancestor !

244
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:05,400
Not bad,

245
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:06,480
at this speed

246
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,320
we will reach

247
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:09,880
the trade planet in a month.

248
00:14:11,110 --> 00:14:11,880
Right,

249
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:13,920
I almost forgot this.

250
00:14:14,320 --> 00:14:15,400
While you were gone,

251
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:17,520
I took a stroll around Forsaken Immortal Clan

252
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:19,960
and picked up a bunch of these things.

253
00:14:20,400 --> 00:14:21,600
It's for you, take them.

254
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:23,000
Thank you.

255
00:14:24,680 --> 00:14:26,160
You're going to planet Tian Yun, right ?

256
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:27,440
You must get ready.

257
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:32,400
After watching you fight,

258
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:34,520
I think you rely too much on artifacts.

259
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:36,520
Your spells aren't that good...

260
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:37,880
Since that's the case,

261
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:39,560
I will teach you 3 spells !

262
00:14:40,280 --> 00:14:41,880
I created these 3 spells

263
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:45,520
with my insights after thousands of years of cultivation.

264
00:14:45,880 --> 00:14:47,320
Their power is unmatched.

265
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:48,520
Wang Lin,

266
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:51,320
you're the only person I will ever pass these to !

267
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:03,880
Death Finger !

268
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:27,400
Demonic Finger !

269
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:33,160
These are...

270
00:15:33,760 --> 00:15:34,640
demonic flames ?

271
00:15:34,680 --> 00:15:36,000
This is the final move...

272
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,160
Little Lin,

273
00:15:37,280 --> 00:15:38,360
watch closely !

274
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:53,160
Underworld Finger !

275
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:01,280
Let's go,

276
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:02,680
spar with me.

277
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:05,200
Let me see how much you've learned !

278
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:13,400
1 month later

279
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,280
Not bad, not bad.

280
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,560
I don't need to worry about you now.

281
00:16:21,920 --> 00:16:23,360
If you want to know something else,

282
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:24,520
ask me now.

283
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:26,600
Situ,

284
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:28,480
what is there

285
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:29,640
after Ascendant ?

286
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:31,680
Cultivators embarking on the path of immortality

287
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:34,200
all believe that cultivation begins with Qi Condensation

288
00:16:34,840 --> 00:16:36,360
and ends with Ascendant.

289
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:37,920
But they don't realize

290
00:16:37,920 --> 00:16:40,520
that this is merely the first step.

291
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:42,520
Above this...

292
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:45,000
there is a second step.

293
00:16:45,680 --> 00:16:46,640
The second step ?

294
00:16:46,680 --> 00:16:47,280
Exactly !

295
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:51,720
Ye Wuyou and I obtained this information from the Cultivation Alliance back then.

296
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:52,800
The second step

297
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:55,240
is called the 3 realms of Nirvana Shattering:

298
00:16:56,440 --> 00:16:57,440
Nirvana Scryer,

299
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:59,400
Nirvana Cleanser,

300
00:16:59,560 --> 00:17:01,160
and finally Nirvana Shatterer.

301
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:02,280
These realms

302
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:04,520
are the path beyond Ascendant.

303
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:06,720
Is your cultivation

304
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:08,120
Nirvana Scryer ?

305
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:10,040
It's not that easy.

306
00:17:10,560 --> 00:17:12,120
Before the second step,

307
00:17:12,320 --> 00:17:13,960
there are still two trials:

308
00:17:14,080 --> 00:17:15,840
Illusory Yin an Corporeal Yang.

309
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:17,000
A cultivator's domain

310
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:19,280
will be tempered by the Illusory Yin and Corporeal Yang stages.

311
00:17:19,320 --> 00:17:22,000
Only then will you be able to enter Nirvana Scryer.

312
00:17:25,840 --> 00:17:26,640
We've arrived.

313
00:17:27,080 --> 00:17:29,000
No matter what materials you need,

314
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:30,640
this trade planet

315
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:32,080
will definitely have them !

316
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:32,200
Trade Planet
Alliance Star System

317
00:17:34,040 --> 00:17:34,880
Little Lin,

318
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:36,400
I'm going ahead

319
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:37,680
to plunder to my heart's content !

320
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:39,640
You can look around by yourself,

321
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:41,480
let's meet in 3 days.

322
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:49,880
I hope that this trade planet

323
00:17:50,800 --> 00:17:52,800
has materials to refine my Star Compass.

324
00:17:55,080 --> 00:17:58,200
Ming Mei City
Trade Planet

325
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:01,120
Feel free to pick whatever you like.

326
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:04,240
I thought it would take more effort

327
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:06,120
to buy this Void Wood Stone.

328
00:18:04,390 --> 00:18:07,270
Void Wood Stone

329
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:09,480
This trade planet is pretty convenient.

330
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:12,440
I just need some Snow Ink,

331
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:15,080
but I can't find it anywhere.

332
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:20,480
Shang clan’s shop

333
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:20,320
I heard this Shang clan's shop claims to have everything.

334
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:23,280
Maybe they have some...

335
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:29,080
Stop right here !

336
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:33,960
You !

337
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:35,960
This is a place for nobles.

338
00:18:36,280 --> 00:18:37,680
Who the hell are you ?

339
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:38,800
Get out of here !

340
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:43,120
A fight started !

341
00:18:47,880 --> 00:18:48,760
Such fast attacks,

342
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:49,680
look !

343
00:18:54,520 --> 00:18:55,800
Young Master, save me !

344
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:56,080
Stop.

345
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:05,160
Star Rotation !

346
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:07,710
Note: this is another spell Situ Nan taught that wasn't shown.

347
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:12,160
You actually ruined my cultivation foundation !

348
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:19,600
Bai Wei
Heavenly Fate Sect Purple Division disciple
Middle stage Soul Transformation

349
00:19:17,040 --> 00:19:18,400
It's already over...

350
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:19,560
Impressive spell, Brother.

351
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:22,320
May I know what your name is ?

352
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:24,440
Wang Lin.

353
00:19:25,400 --> 00:19:26,320
Wang Lin...

354
00:19:27,440 --> 00:19:28,600
I am Bai Wei.

355
00:19:29,760 --> 00:19:30,520
Young Master,

356
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:31,160
kill him !

357
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:33,240
Brother Wang,

358
00:19:34,080 --> 00:19:35,360
my servant was rude.

359
00:19:35,480 --> 00:19:36,880
Please don't be offended.

360
00:19:37,320 --> 00:19:38,720
I am from planet Tian Yun,

361
00:19:38,840 --> 00:19:40,720
a disciple of the Heavenly Fate Sect.

362
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:43,280
May I ask where Brother Wang is from ?

363
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:45,880
I'm a rogue cultivator

364
00:19:46,040 --> 00:19:47,200
without a sect or planet.

365
00:19:51,840 --> 00:19:53,360
Since Brother Wang is unwilling to speak,

366
00:19:54,040 --> 00:19:55,480
then I will not inquire any further.

367
00:19:56,800 --> 00:20:00,040
My master celebrates his birthday every 10 000 years and it's very soon.

368
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:01,280
If Brother Wang has time,

369
00:20:01,760 --> 00:20:03,440
please come to planet Tian Yun

370
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:06,560
and allow me to be your host.

371
00:20:16,600 --> 00:20:17,840
Young master, have a look.

372
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:19,520
So expensive !

373
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:21,280
Snow Ink

374
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:24,200
In Ming Mei City

375
00:20:24,280 --> 00:20:25,560
at the Shang clan's shop,

376
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:26,640
I want the Snow Ink.

377
00:20:26,960 --> 00:20:27,840
Stop running !

378
00:20:28,360 --> 00:20:29,280
Stop this !

379
00:20:34,560 --> 00:20:35,400
Come on, come on !

380
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:37,600
Thief, return my Snow Ink !

381
00:20:39,320 --> 00:20:41,000
I'm not some young lady,

382
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:42,960
why are you idiots chasing after me ?

383
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:44,880
You're not getting away !

384
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:54,600
Here, Snow Ink.

385
00:20:56,320 --> 00:20:57,240
Little Lin...

386
00:21:00,680 --> 00:21:01,760
I'm leaving.

387
00:21:05,640 --> 00:21:07,800
You can finally live like a king.

388
00:21:07,840 --> 00:21:09,320
I'm sure we'll meet again...

389
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:13,320
That's right !

390
00:21:13,760 --> 00:21:16,040
I'm going to enjoy the rest of my life

391
00:21:16,680 --> 00:21:17,960
to the fullest.

392
00:21:28,280 --> 00:21:29,400
A celestial artifact !?

393
00:21:30,120 --> 00:21:32,080
And it's infinitely close to middle grade ?

394
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:36,520
Kid, how did you obtain so many treasures ?

395
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,000
This is...

396
00:21:44,480 --> 00:21:46,400
the method to control this celestial artifact ?

397
00:21:49,320 --> 00:21:50,160
Little Lin,

398
00:21:50,360 --> 00:21:52,520
are you giving me this God Slaying Chariot ?

399
00:21:58,080 --> 00:21:58,800
What ?

400
00:21:59,640 --> 00:22:00,520
You don't want it ?

401
00:22:01,120 --> 00:22:02,760
Who said I didn't want it !?

402
00:22:10,480 --> 00:22:11,200
Wang Lin,

403
00:22:11,680 --> 00:22:13,560
planet Tian Yun is filled with strangers,

404
00:22:13,760 --> 00:22:14,760
be careful.

405
00:22:16,480 --> 00:22:19,040
However, you can’t forget your pride as a cultivator of planet Suzaku.

406
00:22:19,280 --> 00:22:20,720
If you have any problems,

407
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:22,520
come find me on planet Feng Luan.

408
00:22:23,320 --> 00:22:24,680
With this old man around,

409
00:22:24,760 --> 00:22:26,400
no one will dare to mess with you !

410
00:22:28,600 --> 00:22:29,880
Don't get ahead of yourself.

411
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:32,000
If you ever get your ass kicked,

412
00:22:32,720 --> 00:22:34,000
come find me on planet Tian Yun.

413
00:22:35,160 --> 00:22:36,280
With me around,

414
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:38,000
no one will dare to touch you !

415
00:22:39,320 --> 00:22:40,440
Keep that mentality !

416
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:42,040
Fine,

417
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:44,800
if I'm ever in trouble,

418
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:46,680
I'll come and find you.

419
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:49,080
You better make a name for yourself !

420
00:22:49,480 --> 00:22:50,720
Because I'll be ashamed

421
00:22:50,880 --> 00:22:52,360
if you don't.

422
00:23:01,320 --> 00:23:02,200
Wang Lin,

423
00:23:03,240 --> 00:23:04,160
take care.

424
00:23:09,640 --> 00:23:10,520
I wonder if

425
00:23:12,080 --> 00:23:13,680
we will have another chance to meet.

426
00:23:15,680 --> 00:23:16,280
Situ,

427
00:23:17,200 --> 00:23:17,960
take care.

428
00:23:19,520 --> 00:23:21,280
I, Wang Lin, have never in my life

429
00:23:21,760 --> 00:23:23,990
bowed to the heavens or the earth.

430
00:23:24,080 --> 00:23:26,240
I pay respects to neither ghosts or gods.

431
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:28,080
I only bow to my parents

432
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:30,960
and pay respects to Situ...

433
00:23:45,910 --> 00:26:22,070
There is an after credits scene.

434
00:24:03,030 --> 00:24:06,330
To let go of the consequences of my actions

435
00:24:06,330 --> 00:24:08,050
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

436
00:24:08,090 --> 00:24:09,990
like scattered ink.

437
00:24:10,870 --> 00:24:17,470
As destiny falls

438
00:24:13,710 --> 00:24:17,470
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

439
00:24:17,470 --> 00:24:25,070
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

440
00:24:20,710 --> 00:24:25,070
wither and melt into rivers.

441
00:24:25,510 --> 00:24:32,630
Who can deceive

442
00:24:28,270 --> 00:24:32,630
the law of the heavens ?

443
00:24:32,950 --> 00:24:35,950
Countless generations

444
00:24:34,230 --> 00:24:35,950
have tried before me.

445
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:39,670
But how could I not catch my dreams

446
00:24:38,070 --> 00:24:39,670
within my warm fingers ?

447
00:24:40,230 --> 00:24:43,750
You're at my side when I'm alone

448
00:24:43,750 --> 00:24:47,070
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

449
00:24:47,830 --> 00:24:51,030
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

450
00:24:51,390 --> 00:24:55,230
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

451
00:24:53,230 --> 00:24:55,230
in the streets.

452
00:24:55,390 --> 00:25:00,190
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

453
00:24:56,950 --> 00:25:00,190
Can I break the rules ?

454
00:25:00,200 --> 00:25:02,910
To run towards you !

455
00:25:02,950 --> 00:25:06,230
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

456
00:25:06,230 --> 00:25:10,870
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

457
00:25:10,870 --> 00:25:14,270
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

458
00:25:14,310 --> 00:25:18,950
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

459
00:25:19,400 --> 00:25:24,630
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

460
00:25:24,750 --> 00:25:28,550
If your soul is willing to wander,

461
00:25:28,550 --> 00:25:33,190
can I still take your hands

462
00:25:30,230 --> 00:25:33,190
and hold them tight ?

463
00:25:33,350 --> 00:25:36,270
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

464
00:25:36,270 --> 00:25:41,150
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

465
00:25:41,160 --> 00:25:44,430
I dream of destroying

466
00:25:44,590 --> 00:25:49,150
the shackles of our fate.

467
00:25:49,150 --> 00:25:53,110
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

468
00:25:53,110 --> 00:25:55,910
You're the hardest to let go of.

469
00:25:55,990 --> 00:25:59,790
I want to be with you again

470
00:25:59,870 --> 00:26:03,150
so I can look in your eyes.

471
00:26:03,430 --> 00:26:08,390
Even for a moment, it's worth it.

472
00:26:37,190 --> 00:26:38,110
Wang Lin...

473
00:26:38,870 --> 00:26:40,030
Next time,

474
00:26:40,510 --> 00:26:41,630
you definitely

475
00:26:42,630 --> 00:26:45,150
won't escape my grasp !
